1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:05,850
With several positions open, you can close them together.

2
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:09,470
Click Bulk Operations.

3
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:16,080
Close all positions, only the ones in profit, or only the ones at a loss.

4
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:20,380
You are asked to confirm, with the number of positions that will close.

5
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:26,990
Click Close Positions.

6
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:29,990
Both positions are closed at the current price.

